<title>ITALY: Italy 1997 borrowing programme 11-14 bln dlrs.</title>
<headline>Italy 1997 borrowing programme 11-14 bln dlrs.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian Treasury said on Monday that the country's foreign borrowing programme for 1997 would be between $11-14 billion.</p>
<p>In the last three years, Italy's planned borrowing programme has ranged between $12-15 billion a year. -- Rome newsroom +396-6782501</p>
